      "timestamp_sec": 0,
      "why": "Second concrete datapoint that token budgeting is failing at scale."
    },
    {
      "text": "But in case of using these rented intelligence platform, they are like prepaid. You load credits. It's almost as if you're loading credits inside a casino.",
      "timestamp_sec": 38,
      "why": "The central metaphor for why inference spend escapes control."
    },
    {
